# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-f33e720887490e6ee6dd21708cb87c27101cb78a "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]].

Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-ba8dcb4392f541b4f5ae0bf946ee46a3d169fc51 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
